<title>UK: BOE buys 50 mln stg bills/FRG at 5-31/32 percent.</title>
<headline>BOE buys 50 mln stg bills/FRG at 5-31/32 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it bought 50 million stg of bills/FRG for resale to the market on November 15 at 5-31/32 percent.  </p>
<p>			    EARLY	1200 GMT   1400 GMT   LATE</p>
<p> FORECAST SHORTAGE    1.5 BLN    =	    =	    =</p>
<p> CUMULATIVE SUPPLY     50 MLN    =	    =	    =</p>
<p>DETAILS</p>
<p> BILLS/FRG TO NOV 15   50 MLN*   =	    =	    =</p>
<p>* INTEREST RATE - 5-31/32 PCT (INDICATES UNCHANGED BASE RATES)</p>
</text>
